requirements
============
- git
- gcc compiler
- meson
- ninja
- btrfs-progs (libbtrfsutil)
- util-linux-libs (libblkid, libmount)

building from source
====================
1. clone repo with git
	git clone https://github.com/harrygitmail/plank.git

2. change dir to project
	cd ./plank/src/

3. setup builddir
	meson setup builddir

4. compile plank
	meson compile -C builddir

installation
============
to install binary to your system
	sudo meson install -C builddir

it will install binary to standards-conforming location.

to know more about meson refer to following link.
https://mesonbuild.com/

debugging
========
you can use your own debuging flow. i mostly use address senitizer and
UB senitizer by applying options to build dir.
	meson configure builldir -Db_sanitize=address,undefined
